# Keep binary files binary: git's content heuristic can misdetect a PDF as text (e.g. when its first
# bytes happen to be mostly ASCII before any compressed/binary stream), which lets core.autocrlf mangle
# it on checkout. Force these extensions explicitly instead of relying on auto-detection.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
